  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "请求链",
      "items": [
        "Glide.with() 交给 RequestManagerRetriever，按 Activity/Fragment/View 取生命周期绑定好的 RequestManager",
        "RequestBuilder.into() 先 buildRequest，再 requestManager.clear(target) + track(target, request) 接管旧请求"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "复用链",
      "items": [
        "Engine.load 先用 EngineKey 查 ActiveResources，再查 MemoryCache，都未命中才新建 EngineJob 并交给 DecodeJob",
        "DecodeJob 按 RESOURCE_CACHE → DATA_CACHE → SOURCE 依次降级，成功后写回磁盘与内存"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "生命周期",
      "items": [
        "RequestManager.onStop 默认 pauseRequests，onDestroy 时 clearRequests 并从 lifecycle 反注册",
        "Target 的 onLoadCleared 让 ViewTarget 在宿主销毁时释放 Bitmap，避免持有已死的 View"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
